OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMany eastern
OL,6,Fand southeastern areas will have a dry
OL,7,Fnight with clear spells and gentle
OL,8,Fwinds. Elsewhere becoming cloudier and
OL,9,Fbreezy, even windy in the northwest,
OL,10,Fwith some showery rain.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FCloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,13,Facross England and Wales will clear to
OL,14,Fleave a dry, fine and very warm
OL,15,Fafternoon. Windy for Scotland and
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland with occasional rain.
